---
const scenarios = [
  {
    label: 'The leg press is down',
    body: 'They tap Swap inside the workout and keep training with a substitute. It applies to today’s session only. Their program stays as you wrote it.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Behind on the week',
    body: 'If they are behind on the week, they get a reminder on Thursday morning, unless you turn reminders off.',
  },
  {
    label: 'Hotel gym all week',
    quote: '“Hotel gym this week. Can I swap the back squat for something with dumbbells?”',
    body: 'Asking in chat sends you a swap to approve, one exercise at a time. Approve it and it holds for the rest of the week. Next week goes back to the program you wrote.',
  },
];

const chips = [
  'Nothing in their program changes without you',
  'Offline workout logging',
];
---

<section id="client-experience" class="py-21 px-6 bg-ink">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-ink mb-5" data-reveal>The client experience</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading text-text max-w-2xl text-[clamp(1.875rem,3vw+1rem,2.75rem)]" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms">
      Your clients can get routine answers between sessions.
    </h2>
    <p class="section-lede text-text-soft text-lg max-w-2xl mb-11 text-balance" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms">
      Client messages can be handled by an AI configured from your coaching methodology and communication style, within the context Wolvec makes available to it.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-9">
      {scenarios.map((s, i) => (
        <div class="hover-card border border-hairline-dark rounded-2xl p-6 bg-surface-1" data-reveal style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 70}ms`}>
          <h3 class="font-display text-text text-lg mb-2">{s.label}</h3>
          {s.quote && <p class="text-text-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed italic mb-3">{s.quote}</p>}
          <p class="text-text-soft text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed">{s.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="section-lede text-text-soft text-base max-w-2xl mb-7 text-balance" data-reveal>
      None of it goes around you. Every reply stays inside the autonomy you&rsquo;ve set. Certain reports of pain, injury, illness, dizziness, chest or breathing symptoms, or other physical distress can trigger Wolvec&rsquo;s limited safety controls and be flagged for you. These controls may not identify every concern.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm text-text-soft" data-reveal>
      {chips.map((c) => (
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-azure"></span> {c}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
